      "conclusion": "Actual leaf is AudioWaveformView, descriptor971bb10 and View conformance8381810. MessageInputWhisperPart selected starting/listening waveform branch6074400 supplies velocity30, spacing3, minHeight0, maskWidth6, StrokeStyle(lineWidth3, lineCap.round, lineJoin.miter, miterLimit10, dash empty, dashPhase0), height28 and Float normalizer(sample*16). Present/missing colors are caller style values. Earlier ComposerDictationWaveform lineWidth2/minHeight2 candidate is a different construction.",
