        "0x6ece0d0"
      ],
      "conclusion": "Edge mask comprises leading-to-trailing linear gradient clear→black of width maskWidth, black center, and leading-to-trailing black→clear gradient of width maskWidth. Caller maskWidth is6. HStack state at6ece1cc stores zero spacing with present optional tag. Mask colors are alpha carriers. No bitmap waveform resource is consumed in this path.",
      "limits": [
        "The exact generic modifier type is not demangled in this slice. Gradient assembly and widths are directly visible."
      ]
    },
    {
