      "conclusion": "Correction to v532: MessageInputWhisperPart+0x28 represents MessageInputWhisperPushToTalkMode, not Bool. Mode projection is disabled0, releaseToSend1, tapToSend2. Source WhisperPushToTalkMode has tapToSend1/releaseToSend2 and16e5534 swaps1/2. A fixture may explicitly choose disabled to exercise the recovered waveform branch.",
